--- headings and paragraphs
## "# Title\n\nSome *text* here.\nSecond line.\n\n### Third ###\n####### not a heading\n#hashtag"
<h1>Title</h1>
<p>Some <em>text</em> here.
Second line.</p>
<h3>Third</h3>
<p>####### not a heading
#hashtag</p>

## "line one  \nline two\\\nline three"
<p>line one<br>
line two<br>
line three</p>

--- inline
## "**bold** and __bold__, *em* and _em_, ***both***, snake_case_name, 2 * 3 * 4, a*b*c"
<p><strong>bold</strong> and <strong>bold</strong>, <em>em</em> and <em>em</em>, <em><strong>both</strong></em>, snake_case_name, 2 * 3 * 4, a<em>b</em>c</p>

## "`code <b>` and ``a ` tick`` and `unclosed"
<p><code>code &lt;b&gt;</code> and <code>a ` tick</code> and `unclosed</p>

## "\\*not em\\* and \\# and \\\\ and a \\q"
<p>*not em* and # and \ and a \q</p>

## "**unclosed bold and *em*"
<p>**unclosed bold and <em>em</em></p>

## "<b>raw html</b> & \"quotes\" 1 < 2"
<p>&lt;b&gt;raw html&lt;/b&gt; &amp; &quot;quotes&quot; 1 &lt; 2</p>

--- links and images
## "[GlowLang](https://glow.example \"Home\") and [a [nested] label](/x) and ![logo](/l.png)"
<p><a href="https://glow.example" title="Home">GlowLang</a> and <a href="/x">a [nested] label</a> and <img src="/l.png" alt="logo"></p>

## "[bad](javascript:alert(1)) [bad2](JavaScript:x) ![ok](data:image/png;base64,AA==) [no](data:text/html,x)"
<p><a href="#">bad</a> <a href="#">bad2</a> <img src="data:image/png;base64,AA==" alt="ok"> <a href="#">no</a></p>

## "<https://glow.example/a?b=1> <ana@glow.example> <not a link> [text](broken"
<p><a href="https://glow.example/a?b=1">https://glow.example/a?b=1</a> <a href="mailto:ana@glow.example">ana@glow.example</a> &lt;not a link&gt; [text](broken</p>

## "[a](<url with spaces> 'single')"
<p><a href="url with spaces" title="single">a</a></p>

--- code blocks
## "```glow\nshow \"<hi>\"\n\nlet x = 1\n```\nafter"
<pre><code class="language-glow">show &quot;&lt;hi&gt;&quot;

let x = 1
</code></pre>
<p>after</p>

## "~~~\nno language\n~~~"
<pre><code>no language
</code></pre>

## "```\nnever closed"
<pre><code>never closed
</code></pre>

--- quotes and rules
## "> quoted *text*\n> more\n>\n> # inside\n\n---\n***\n_ _ _"
<blockquote>
<p>quoted <em>text</em>
more</p>
<h1>inside</h1>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<hr>
<hr>

--- lists
## "- one\n- two\n  - nested a\n  - nested b\n- three"
<ul>
<li>one</li>
<li>two
<ul>
<li>nested a</li>
<li>nested b</li>
</ul></li>
<li>three</li>
</ul>

## "1. first\n2. second\n\n3. third, loose"
<ol>
<li><p>first</p></li>
<li><p>second</p></li>
<li><p>third, loose</p></li>
</ol>

## "3) start at three\n4) four"
<ol start="3">
<li>start at three</li>
<li>four</li>
</ol>

## "* item\ncontinues here\n* next"
<ul>
<li>item
continues here</li>
<li>next</li>
</ul>

## "- a\n\n  second paragraph of a\n- b"
<ul>
<li><p>a</p>
<p>second paragraph of a</p></li>
<li><p>b</p></li>
</ul>

## "- a\n1. b"
<ul>
<li>a</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>b</li>
</ol>

## "- [link](/x) and `code`\n-\n- last"
<ul>
<li><a href="/x">link</a> and <code>code</code></li>
<li></li>
<li>last</li>
</ul>

--- tables
## "| Name | Price | Note |\n|:-----|------:|:----:|\n| tea | 3 | hot |\n| cake | 5 |\n| pipe \\| in cell | `a|b` | x |"
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="left">Name</th>
<th align="right">Price</th>
<th align="center">Note</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left">tea</td>
<td align="right">3</td>
<td align="center">hot</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left">cake</td>
<td align="right">5</td>
<td align="center"></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left">pipe | in cell</td>
<td align="right">`a</td>
<td align="center">b`</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

## "a | b\n--|--"
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>a</th>
<th>b</th>
</tr>
</thead>
</table>

--- edge cases
## ""

## "\n\n\n"

## "plain"
<p>plain</p>

## "Windows\r\nlines\r\n\r\n- x\r\n"
<p>Windows
lines</p>
<ul>
<li>x</li>
</ul>

## "tab\there"
<p>tab    here</p>

--- unmatched emphasis stays fast
true true
